ne vanilla JS function.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="17">5. QA &amp; Previous Phases Status</h3><ul data-path-to-node="18"><li><p data-path-to-node="18,0,0">‚úÖ Web Audio API Oscillator (165Hz/240Hz/440Hz) works perfectly.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,1,0">‚úÖ Multi-bar visualizer and dark theme persistence tested and fully functional.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="20">Phase 6 is complete. Stopping development and waiting for your approval before starting Phase 7.</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" _nghost-ng-c81433311="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" _nghost-ng-c3358577162="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057436502="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2057436502-9 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3003419454-10 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c2057436502-9 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3003419454=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3003419454="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3003419454-10"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3003419454="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3003419454-10 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3003419454="" _nghost-ng-c2080450929="" class="ng-tns-c3003419454-10 luminous-theme ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2080450929="" tabindex="-1" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="Good response" gemtoo