        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>Built for fast performance <span class="hljs-symbol">&amp;amp;</span> high mobile accessibility.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
