de="0">Database Row Level Security (RLS)</b>: Public client access is explicitly constrained to <code data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="85">INSERT</code> queries across <code data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="107">contacts</code>, <code data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="117">newsletter_subscribers</code>, <code data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="141">feedback</code>, <code data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="151">analytics_events</code>, and <code data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="173">error_logs</code>. Public users cannot execute <code data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="213">SELECT</code>, <code data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="221">UPDATE</code>, or <code data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="232">DELETE</code> requests.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="20,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="20,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">XSS &amp; Input Sanitization</b>: All client inputs are stripped of script tags and whitespace-trimmed before dispatching SQL commands.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="20,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="20,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">SQL Injection Prevention</b>: Safe parameter binding provided natively via Supabase client library parameterization.</p></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node="22">5. Performance Summary &amp; Phase 1‚Äì10 Verification</h2><ul data-path-to-node="23"><li><p data-path-to-node="23,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Web Audio Latency</b>: Sub-10ms response time using non-blocking asynchronous Web Audio Context resumption.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="23,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="23,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Database Overhead</b>: Lightweight payload transfers (&lt;1KB per event request) using non-blocking asynchronous calls.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="23,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="23,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Phase Continuity</b>: All UI components, responsive breakpoints, light/dark themes, SEO schema tags, and sound frequency modes operate without regressions.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="25">Phase 10 is complete! Development has stopped and the backend architecture is ready. Awaiting your instructions before proceeding to any future phases.</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" _nghost-ng-c81433311="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" _nghost-ng-c3358577162="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057436502="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2057436502-17 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3003419454-18 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c2057436502-17 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3003419454=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3003419454="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3003419454-18"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3003419454="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3003419454-18 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3003419454="" _nghost-ng-c2080450929="" class="ng-tns-c3003419454-18 luminous-theme ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2080450929="" tabindex="-1" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="Good response" gemtooltip="Good response" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-n