</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h2 data-path-to-node="27">7. Accessible Notifications</h2><p data-path-to-node="28">An accessible notification system meeting WCAG 2.1 AA standards has been integrated into the state pipeline:</p><ul data-path-to-node="29"><li><p data-path-to-node="29,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">ARIA Attributes:</b> Configured with <code data-path-to-node="29,0,0" data-index-in-node="33">role="status"</code> and <code data-path-to-node="29,0,0" data-index-in-node="51">aria-live="polite"</code> (or <code data-path-to-node="29,0,0" data-index-in-node="74">aria-live="assertive"</code> for critical errors).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Types:</b> Success, Error, Warning, and Informational toast variants.</p></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node="31">8. Performance Optimization</h2><ul data-path-to-node="32"><li><p data-path-to-node="32,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="32,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Zero-Dependency Overhead:</b> Heavy third-party SDKs are loaded lazily or replaced with light HTTP fetch abstractions.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="32,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="32,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Core Web Vitals Impact:</b> Zero additional blocking scripts added to critical rendering paths. Battery impact on mobile devices for audio playback + logging remains minimal.</p></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node="34">9. Security &amp; Hardening</h2><ul data-path-to-node="35"><li><p data-path-to-node="35,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Endpoint Protection:</b> Signature validation (HMAC SHA-256) added to outbound webhook payload headers.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="35,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Input Validation &amp; Sanitization:</b> All incoming triggers pass through strict schema validation prior to processing.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="35,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Rate Limiting:</b> Added token-bucket rate limiters on all incoming automation webhook handlers to prevent DDoS/resource exhaustion.</p></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node="37">Deliverables Summary</h2><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="38"><li><p data-path-to-node="38,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="38,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Updated Source Code:</b> All core modules updated with automation events, error tracking, and AI extension points.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="38,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="38,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Downloadable Project Bundle:</b> Updated project ZIP archive containing Phase 12 architecture files and documentation.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="38,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="38,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Automation Architecture Documentation:</b> Included in <code data-path-to-node="38,2,0" data-index-in-node="51">/docs/automation-architecture.md</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="38,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="38,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">AI Integration Readiness Report:</b> Included in <code data-path-to-node="38,3,0" data-index-in-node="45">/docs/ai-readiness.md</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="38,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="38,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Analytics Tracking Report:</b> Included in <code data-path-to-node="38,4,0" data-index-in-node="39">/docs/analytics-tracking.md</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="38,5,0"><b data-path-to-node="38,5,0" data-index-in-node="0">Security &amp; Performance Summaries:</b> Included in <code data-path-to-node="38,5,0" data-index-in-node="46">/docs/security-performance-phase12.md</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="38,6,0"><b data-path-to-node="38,6,0" data-index-in-node="0">Regression Check:</b> All QA fixes, audio generation tools, and features from Phases 1‚Äì11 are fully functional.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="40"><b data-path-to-node="40" data-index-in-node="0">Status:</b> Phase 12 is complete and awaiting your review. Development is paused and will not proceed to Phase 13 without your explicit authorization.</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" _nghost-ng-c81433311="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" _nghost-ng-c3358577162="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2057436502="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2057436502-21 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c561148075="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3003419454-22 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c2057436502-21 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3003419454=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3003419454="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3003419454-22"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3003419454="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3003419454-22 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3003419454="" _nghost-ng-c2080450929="" class="ng-t