node="131">index.html</code> at the build root. When <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="166">index.html</code> is kept solely in the root directory without clean rewrite directives in <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="250">vercel.json</code>, Vercel fails to map incoming <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="292">/</code> requests to the core document.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Missing SPA/Static Rewrites:</b> Clean URLs or sub-route refreshes lack explicit fallback rewrites, leading Vercel to look for matching physical subfolders rather than routing traffic back through <code data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="193">index.html</code>.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="6">2. Files &amp; Structure Verification</h3><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0" id="p-rc_542eb7590840c848-27"><span data-path-to-node="7,0,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Entry Point:</b> Restored <code data-path-to-node="7,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="22">index.html</code> as the single consolidated entry point combining all features from Phase 1 through Phase 12</span><span data-path-to-node="7,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c88832907="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c88832907="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!